# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — NEVER commit a real key.
#
# CARTO Basemaps API key. Removes the "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark from the
# basemap tiles. Leave empty to run keyless: the map still works, just
# watermarked. Served to the browser by GET /api/config (the browser fetches
# tiles directly, so this credential is client-side by design).
#
# CARTO's free tier is conditional on keeping the CARTO *and* OpenStreetMap
# attribution visible on the map — do not remove the attribution line.
CARTO_API_KEY=
